{"id":"ff60400b5043f5c2","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-tree11-tree-automorphism.md","title":"Tree Automorphism","display":"df-zfc-tree11-tree-automorphism — Tree Automorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree11-tree-automorphism","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree11-tree-automorphism"],"display":"df-zfc-tree11-tree-automorphism — Tree Automorphism","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-embedding.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree11-tree-automorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree11-tree-automorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree11-tree-automorphism — Tree Automorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"31795d01e0ea2e91\" href=\"?note=31795d01e0ea2e91\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-embedding.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-embedding.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-zfc-tree11-tree-automorphism-—-ZFC-Tree11-Tree-Automorphism\">df-zfc-tree11-tree-automorphism — ZFC Tree11 Tree Automorphism</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,T,R,s,t\">\\(f,T,R,s,t\\)</span> (tree parameters and set-coded prefix order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeEmbedding}_S\\)</span> (tree-embedding predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11TreeAutomorphism}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree11TreeAutomorphism}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}tree\\text{-}automorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree11TreeAutomorphism}_S(f,T)\\leftrightarrow \\exists R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(R=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeEmbedding}_S(f;T,R;T,R)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)=T\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}tree\\text{-}automorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree11TreeAutomorphism}_S(f,T)\\leftrightarrow \\exists R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(R=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeEmbedding}_S(f;T,R;T,R)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)=T\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A tree automorphism is a surjective self-embedding; the prefix order is restricted to the set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\times T\">\\(T\\times T\\)</span> before it is passed to the set-coded upstream embedding predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-zfc-tree11-tree-automorphism-—-ZFC-Tree11-Tree-Automorphism","text":"df-zfc-tree11-tree-automorphism — ZFC Tree11 Tree Automorphism","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"31795d01e0ea2e91","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-embedding.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,T,R,s,t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeEmbedding}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11TreeAutomorphism}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}tree\\text{-}automorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree11TreeAutomorphism}_S(f,T)\\leftrightarrow \\exists R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(R=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeEmbedding}_S(f;T,R;T,R)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)=T\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"T\\times T","display":false}],"bytes":1094,"backlinks":[{"id":"51544746a7792e0d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree11TreeAutomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (tree-automorphism predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree11-tree-automorphism.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3804","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree11-tree-automorphism.md|58-df-zfc-tree11-tree-automorphism]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","31795d01e0ea2e91"]}